(7744261, 1278117, 67145, '<td valign="top">i''m mesmerized ... i''m reaching for the box but its really hard to do ..<br/>i think i''ve been hypnotized .. <br/>now i''m going to have to google the difference between mesmerized and hynotized .. <br/> <br/>BRB .. <br/> <br/>ok .. i''m sure you''d like to know too .. so here''s the difference .. <br/><i>"They are actually synonyms of each other &amp; can be used interchangeably (depending on what is being expressed) however hypnotize has a literal meaning of putting someone into a trance or a hypnotic state. Mesmerize just means to grab &amp; hold someone''s attention."</i> <br/> <br/>later that day .. <br/> <br/>i''ve been able to reach for the two arrows to make this strange and impelling image disappear .. i think i traveled out of my body there for a while .. ;)</td>', 'i''m mesmerized ... i''m reaching for the box but its really hard to do ..i think i''ve been hypnotized .. now i''m going to have to google the difference between mesmerized and hynotized ..  BRB ..  ok .. i''m sure you''d like to know too .. so here''s the difference .. "They are actually synonyms of each other & can be used interchangeably (depending on what is being expressed) however hypnotize has a literal meaning of putting someone into a trance or a hypnotic state. Mesmerize just means to grab & hold someone''s attention."  later that day ..  i''ve been able to reach for the two arrows to make this strange and impelling image disappear .. i think i traveled out of my body there for a while .. ;)', '2023-05-10 02:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
